00:00:00,535 --> 00:00:02,235
(Raj:)Okay, okay.

2
00:00:03,405 --> 00:00:05,975
(Raj:)Although many older women
lead vibrant, active...

3
00:00:05,974 --> 00:00:07,774
I said well past it!

4
00:00:10,545 --> 00:00:13,075
(Sheldon:)Excuse me,
Officer Hernandez?

5
00:00:13,081 --> 00:00:16,081
(Sheldon:)Any leads on the person
who stole my belongings?

6
00:00:16,084 --> 00:00:17,154
