7
00:00:17,152 --> 00:00:18,382
(Sheldon:)Well, perhaps I can help.

8
00:00:18,386 --> 00:00:20,256
(Sheldon:)Sherlock Holmes
always says

9
00:00:20,255 --> 00:00:23,385
(Sheldon:)when you eliminate
the impossible,

10
00:00:23,391 --> 00:00:25,691
(Sheldon:)whatever remains,
however improbable,

11
