called "Officer Hernandez."

17
00:00:47,582 --> 00:00:49,752
(Leonard:)Thanks again
for coming.

18
00:00:49,751 --> 00:00:52,021
(Leonard:)Six hours was gonna be
a long drive by myself.

19
00:00:52,020 --> 00:00:53,350
